  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Preview 2 improves config-driven multi-profile builds. Adds profile.needsProfile for\n      staging another profile's compiled apps before a dependent profile builds, and\n      profile.outputSuffix for labelling generated .app artifacts. Fixes profile output\n      collection so compiled apps are moved out of the shared package cache after each\n      profile, restoring the cache to a symbols-only state and avoiding duplicate-app\n      failures in later profiles. See CHANGELOG.md for full details.",
